@startuml 图1-4 域模型（分析类图 · 名词短语法 + CRC）
' 依据：docs/需求规格说明书.md §2.4（名词短语判定表 / CRC 卡片 / 基数表）
' 约定：类名 "中文 English" as 别名；字段只列分析阶段能确定的；
'       方法在分析阶段可省，设计阶段（实验二）再补全。

skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #F5F9FF
  BorderColor #2E5C8A
  ArrowColor #555555
}
hide empty members
hide circle

title 域模型：碳中和城市绿色出行积分系统

' ================= 账户与主体 =================

class "用户 User" as User <<实体类>> {
  + id: bigint
  + phone: varchar(20)
  + nickname: varchar(64)
  + passwordHash: varchar(100)
  + role: UserRole {CITIZEN}
  + status: UserStatus {ACTIVE|FROZEN}
  + createdAt: datetime
}

class "管理员 AdminUser" as AdminUser <<实体类>> {
  + id: bigint
  + username: varchar(64)
  + deptRole: {OPERATOR|CERTIFIER}
  + status: enum
}

class "商户 Merchant" as Merchant <<实体类>> {
  + id: bigint
  + name: varchar(128)
  + contact: varchar(64)
  + settleCycle: {MONTHLY|WEEKLY}
  + status: enum
}

' ================= 出行与碳核算 =================

class "出行方式 TravelMode" as TravelMode <<实体类 · 字典>> {
  + code: varchar(32)
  + name: varchar(64)
  + efBase: decimal(8,3)
  + efActual: decimal(8,3)
  + enabled: bool
}

class "系统参数 SysConfig" as SysConfig <<实体类 · 字典>> {
  + configKey: varchar(64)
  + configValue: varchar(255)
  + valueType: enum
  + description: varchar(255)
}

class "出行记录 TripRecord" as TripRecord <<实体类>> {
  + id: bigint
  + userId: bigint
  + modeCode: varchar(32)
  + distanceKm: decimal(8,3)
  + startedAt: datetime
  + endedAt: datetime
  + tripHash: varchar(64) {unique with userId}
  + source: {APP|SIMULATOR|ADMIN}
  + status: {VALID|REVOKED}
}

class "碳减排记录 CarbonRecord" as CarbonRecord <<实体类>> {
  + id: bigint
  + tripId: bigint
  + efBase: decimal(8,3)
  + efActual: decimal(8,3)
  + carbonSavedG: decimal(12,3)
  + ruleSnapshot: varchar(255)
  + computedAt: datetime
}

' ================= 积分账本 =================

class "积分账户 PointAccount" as PointAccount <<实体类 · 余额快照>> {
  + id: bigint
  + userId: bigint
  + balance: bigint
  + frozen: bigint
  + totalSavedG: decimal(14,3)
  + version: int {乐观锁}
  + updatedAt: datetime
}

class "积分流水 PointTxn" as PointTxn <<实体类 · 只增不改>> {
  + id: bigint
  + accountId: bigint
  + txnType: {TRAVEL|REDEEM|REFUND|ADJUST|EXPIRE}
  + amount: bigint {正数增，负数减}
  + bizRefType: varchar(32)
  + bizRefId: bigint
  + balanceAfter: bigint
  + occurredAt: datetime
}

' ================= 商城与订单 =================

class "商品 Product" as Product <<实体类>> {
  + id: bigint
  + merchantId: bigint
  + name: varchar(128)
  + category: varchar(32)
  + coverUrl: varchar(255)
  + status: {DRAFT|ONLINE|OFFLINE}
  + sortOrder: int
}

class "商品规格 ProductSku" as ProductSku <<实体类>> {
  + id: bigint
  + productId: bigint
  + skuName: varchar(64)
  + pointsPrice: bigint
  + stock: int {≥0}
  + soldCount: int
}

class "兑换订单 RedeemOrder" as RedeemOrder <<实体类>> {
  + id: bigint
  + orderNo: varchar(32)
  + userId: bigint
  + skuId: bigint
  + pointsSpent: bigint
  + status: {PENDING|PAID|SHIPPED|COMPLETED|CANCELLED}
  + redeemCode: varchar(64)
  + idempotencyKey: varchar(64)
  + shippedAt: datetime
}

' ================= 事件与审计 =================

class "事件发件箱 EventOutbox" as EventOutbox <<实体类>> {
  + id: bigint
  + eventId: varchar(64) {unique}
  + eventType: varchar(64)
  + aggregateType: varchar(32)
  + aggregateId: bigint
  + payload: json
  + status: {NEW|SENT|FAILED|DEAD}
  + retryCount: int
  + nextRetryAt: datetime
}

class "审计日志 AuditLog" as AuditLog <<实体类>> {
  + id: bigint
  + actorType: {USER|ADMIN|SYSTEM}
  + actorId: bigint
  + action: varchar(64)
  + targetType: varchar(32)
  + targetId: bigint
  + beforeValue: json
  + afterValue: json
  + reason: varchar(255)
  + createdAt: datetime
}

' ================= 关系与基数 =================

User "1" -- "0..*" TripRecord : 上报 >
User "1" -- "1" PointAccount : 持有 >
User "1" -- "0..*" RedeemOrder : 发起 >
User "1" -- "0..*" AuditLog : 操作 >

TravelMode "1" -- "0..*" TripRecord : 被引用 >
TripRecord "1" -- "1" CarbonRecord : 产生 >
CarbonRecord ..> SysConfig : 规则快照来源

PointAccount "1" -- "0..*" PointTxn : 记账 >
RedeemOrder "1" -- "0..*" PointTxn : 兑换/冲正 >
TripRecord "1" -- "0..*" PointTxn : 发放来源 >

Merchant "1" -- "0..*" Product : 供货 >
Product "1" -- "1..*" ProductSku : 包含 >
ProductSku "1" -- "0..*" RedeemOrder : 被兑换 >

AdminUser "1" -- "0..*" AuditLog : 操作 >

EventOutbox ..> TripRecord : aggregateType=Trip
EventOutbox ..> RedeemOrder : aggregateType=Order

note bottom of PointAccount
  **为什么积分一分为二**
  PointAccount = 余额快照（可并发更新、查得快）
  PointTxn     = 只增流水（事实来源、可对账）
  不变量：balance == Σ(PointTxn.amount)   ← BR-07
end note

note bottom of EventOutbox
  **EDA 落地点**
  业务写与事件写同一本地事务，
  Worker 轮询后按 eventId 幂等投递，
  保证"业务成功则事件必达"（至少一次）。
end note

legend right
  ``<<实体类>>`` 均映射为数据库表（snake_case）：
  TripRecord → trip_record，PointTxn → point_txn ……
  字典表：travel_mode / sys_config（参数化，禁止硬编码）
endlegend

@enduml
